cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt this method, its code or its published estimates, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "NZ ETS auction outlook"
abstract: >-
  Weekly estimates of the chance that upcoming New Zealand Emissions Trading Scheme (NZ ETS) auctions sell units:
  the probability the NZU price is at or above the auction floor (from empirical price ranges over the previous three years) multiplied by
  the historical rate at which auctions above the floor have cleared the reserve price.
authors:
